<title>RUSSIA: Rouble higher at 3,607.50 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble higher at 3,607.50 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble rose to 3,607.50 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,618.00 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 3		  Sept 2</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,607.50		3,618.00</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    1.62		    2.30</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
